1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:05,420
二手書交易，最怕面交被放鳥，寄送又麻煩。
In secondhand book trading, the biggest worries are no-shows at meetups and the hassle of shipping.

2
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:09,160
問卷中，57.4% 的人認為，
In our survey, 57.4% of respondents said

3
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:12,650
書櫃最吸引人的是「24 小時自助」。
the most appealing feature of the locker is 24-hour self-service.

4
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:16,070
救「舊」我的書，結合 App 與智慧書櫃，
SaveMyBook combines an app with smart lockers,

5
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:18,730
買賣雙方不必約時間見面。
so buyers and sellers never need to arrange a meeting.

6
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:21,830
線上看書況、付款，
Check the book's condition and pay online;

7
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:25,780
賣家存書、買家取書，驗收後才撥款。
the seller drops off, the buyer picks up, and payment is released only after acceptance.

8
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:32,380
賣家掃描 ISBN，系統自動帶出書名、作者與出版社。
Sellers scan the ISBN, and the system fills in the title, author, and publisher automatically.

9
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:37,770
拍下書況照片，AI 判斷書況，並建議售價區間。
Take photos of the book, and AI assesses its condition and suggests a price range.

10
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:43,170
上架內容再經規則與 AI 雙層審核，把關品質。
Listings then pass a two-layer review by rules and AI to ensure quality.

11
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:48,020
買家可以用書名、作者或 ISBN 搜尋，
Buyers can search by title, author, or ISBN,

12
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,110
也會收到個人化推薦。
and also receive personalized recommendations.

13
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:54,720
說出需求與預算，AI 書籍顧問幫你挑書。
Describe your needs and budget, and the AI book advisor helps you choose.

14
00:00:54,970 --> 00:00:57,980
聊天室支援文字、圖片與語音，
Chat supports text, images, and voice messages,

15
00:00:57,980 --> 00:01:01,900
出現高風險訊息時，會即時提醒防詐。
with instant fraud alerts whenever a high-risk message appears.

16
00:01:02,850 --> 00:01:08,260
付款以交易密碼或生物辨識驗證，款項先由平台暫管。
Payments are verified by a transaction PIN or biometrics, and the platform holds the funds in escrow.

17
00:01:09,210 --> 00:01:12,150
智慧書櫃以一片 ESP32-S3，
A single ESP32-S3 controls

18
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:16,040
控制四扇電磁鎖櫃門與螢幕。
the locker's four electromagnetic-lock doors and its screen.

19
00:01:16,290 --> 00:01:19,520
開櫃前，必須在書櫃 200 公尺內，
To open a door, you must be within 200 meters of the locker

20
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:22,360
掃描每 30 秒更新的 QR Code，
and scan its QR code, which refreshes every 30 seconds,

21
00:01:22,610 --> 00:01:26,110
再於 60 秒內輸入螢幕上的兩位數字，
then enter the two-digit number on its screen within 60 seconds

22
00:01:26,110 --> 00:01:28,310
指定的櫃門才會開啟。
before the assigned door opens.

23
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:32,980
關上櫃門，系統登記存書，並通知買家。
Once the door is closed, the system records the drop-off and notifies the buyer.

24
00:01:33,230 --> 00:01:35,670
App 也整合臺北市開放資料，
The app also integrates Taipei City open data

25
00:01:35,670 --> 00:01:39,580
提供前往書櫃的捷運、公車與 YouBike 資訊。
to show MRT, bus, and YouBike options for getting to the locker.

26
00:01:40,530 --> 00:01:44,530
買家用同樣的方式取書，當場檢查書況；
Buyers pick up the same way and check the book on the spot;

27
00:01:44,530 --> 00:01:48,880
滿 24 小時沒有爭議，款項自動撥給賣家。
if there is no dispute within 24 hours, payment goes to the seller automatically.

28
00:01:49,130 --> 00:01:52,660
書況不符，可以附上照片申請爭議，
If the condition does not match, buyers can file a dispute with photos,

29
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:56,320
AI 比對上架資料，協助管理員處理。
and AI compares it with the listing to assist administrators.

30
00:01:56,570 --> 00:01:59,910
使用上的問題，AI 客服即時回答，
For questions, the AI support assistant answers instantly,

31
00:01:59,910 --> 00:02:02,180
也能一鍵轉接真人。
with one-tap transfer to a human agent.

32
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:07,250
從上架、選書到售後，七項 AI 服務全程協助。
From listing and choosing books to after-sales support, seven AI services assist throughout.

33
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:11,790
登入支援 Google、Apple、LINE、
Sign in with Google, Apple, LINE,

34
00:02:11,790 --> 00:02:13,910
手機簡訊與通行密鑰等多種方式。
SMS, passkeys, and more.

35
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:17,420
完成交易可以累積點數、升級會員，
Completed trades earn points toward membership upgrades,

36
00:02:17,420 --> 00:02:20,990
介面支援五種語言與深淺色主題。
and the interface supports five languages and light and dark themes.

37
00:02:21,940 --> 00:02:24,120
管理後台整合在 App 中，
The admin console is built into the app,

38
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:28,070
可以處理上架審核、訂單、爭議與公告；
handling listing reviews, orders, disputes, and announcements;

39
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:33,300
輸入書櫃螢幕上的八位數配對碼，就能連線新書櫃。
entering the eight-digit pairing code on a locker's screen connects a new locker.

40
00:02:34,250 --> 00:02:36,640
系統以 Flutter、Node.js、
The system is built with Flutter, Node.js,

41
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:40,470
MariaDB 與 ESP32-S3 打造，
MariaDB, and ESP32-S3,

42
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,670
共 304 個 API，
with 304 APIs,

43
00:02:42,670 --> 00:02:46,920
前後端超過四千項自動化測試全數通過。
and more than 4,000 automated front-end and back-end tests, all passing.

44
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:52,640
救「舊」我的書，讓閒置的書，在校園裡重新流動。
SaveMyBook: letting idle books circulate again on campus.
